      "block_id": "2605.28896_p12_b14",
      "text": "A clear rank effect emerges at layers 22 and 32: higher rank produces lower CKA(hb, h\u2206),\nindicating more representationally distinct delta contributions at middle layers. At layer 22:\nr = 4 \u21920.194, r = 32 \u21920.093. Critically, CKA(hb, ha) remains above 0.93 at all conditions,\nconfirming the adapted model is overwhelmingly similar to the base model overall \u2014 the delta\nis a small but geometrically distinct perturbation.\n",
